recommend keep-going — next agent-doable crux is another Photos gesture (a bilinear/area resampler, or hue/saturation as a bounded verb), the cursor beaded into Tablecloth as a live editing session (stands on HUNK12), or another Season-A / double-seat journey; all agent-doable, no gate.
